            "heading": "5--omniroute-cloud-sync-credential-write-back-apikeysidroutejs",
            "content": "**Why we keep it**: Cloud Sync is the only way for an OmniRoute Cloud tenant\r\nto centralise team credentials. The fix makes the threat model honest:\r\n\"server signs, client verifies, operator opts in.\""
